                                    text="&lt;p>&lt;b>간포트점안액 &lt;/b>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-ganfort-2025-04-02.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>간포트점안액(1회용), 간포트점안액(제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>노비르정 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-norvir-2026-06-01.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>노비르정 (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>라스타카프트점안액 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-lastacaft-2023-04-05.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>라스타카프트점안액0.25%(알카프타딘) (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>레스타시스점안액 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-restasis-2025-10-16.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>레스타시스점안액0.05%(사이클로스포린)(1회용) (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>루미간점안액 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-lumigan-2025-11-07.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>루미간점안액0.01%(비마토프로스트) (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>린버크서방정 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-rinvoq15mg-2026-02-03.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>린버크서방정15밀리그램 (제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-rinvoq30mg-2026-02-03.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>린버크서방정30밀리그램 (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>릴레스타트점안액 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-relestat-2023-03-17.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>릴레스타트점안액 0.05%(에피나스틴염산염) (제품허가정보 PDF&lt;/a> )&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>마비렛정&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-maviret-2025-01-17.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>마비렛정(제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>벤클렉스타정 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-venclexta-10-50-100-2021-01-08.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>벤클렉스타정10밀리그램(베네토클락스) (제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-venclexta-10-50-100-2021-01-08.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>벤클렉스타정50밀리그램(베네토클락스) (제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-venclexta-10-50-100-2021-01-08.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>벤클렉스타정100밀리그램(베네토클락스) (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>보톡스주 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-botox-50u-2024-02-08.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>보톡스주 50 단위(클로스트리디움보툴리눔독소A형) (제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-botox-100u-2024-02-08.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>보톡스주 (클로스트리디움보 툴리눔독소A형) (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>스카이리치 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-skyrizi75-pfs-2026-01-09_upload.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>스카이리치 프리필드시린지주 (제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-skyrizi150-pfs-pen-2026-01-09_upload.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>스카이리치 프리필드펜주 150mg/mL (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>스킨바이브 바이 쥬비덤  &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-juvederm-skinvive-2024-03.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>스킨바이브 바이 쥬비덤 (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>아큐베일점안액 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-acuvail-2023-03-17.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>아큐베일점안액 0.45%(케토롤락트로메타민염)(1회용) (제품 허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&l