i-juvederm-volux-2023-04.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>쥬비덤 볼룩스(제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-juvederm-volift-2023-04.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>쥬비덤 볼리프트 with 리도카인(제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-juvederm-volbella-2023-04.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>쥬비덤 볼벨라 with 리도카인(제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-juvederm-ultraxc-2023-04.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>쥬비덤 울트라 XC(제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-juvederm-ultraplusxc-2023-04.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>쥬비덤 울트라 플러스 XC(제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>콤비간점안액 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-combigan-2026-01-08.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>콤비간점안액 (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>쿨스컬프팅 시스템 &lt;br />&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-coolsculpting-2026-01.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>쿨스컬프팅 시스템 (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>프레드포르테점안액 &lt;/b>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-predforte-2023-03-20.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>프레드포르테점안액(프레드니솔론아세테이트) (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>휴미라주 &lt;/b>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-humira-pen40-2025-08-13.pdf&quot;>휴미라펜주40mg/0.4mL (제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-humira-pfs40mg0-4ml-20250813.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>휴미라프리필드시린지주40mg/0.4mL (제품허가정보 PDF) &lt;/a>&lt;br />&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/kr/documents/products/hp-pi-humira-pfs20-2025-08-13.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>휴미라프리필드시린지주20mg/0.2mL (제품허가정보 PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
